OL,3,GNEWSAFlight disruption and thousands
OL,4,Awithout electricity after Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of homes across the island of
OL,7,FIreland are without power after Storm
OL,8,FBoelo.
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland Electricity Networks
OL,11,F(NIE) said under 1,000 customers remain
OL,12,Faffected, while about 18,000 homes,
OL,13,Ffarms and businesses across the
OL,14,FRepublic of Ireland are without
OL,15,Felectricity on Sunday afternoon.
OL,17,FAbout 350 incidents, including fallen
OL,18,Ftrees and flooding, have been reported
OL,19,Fto the Department for Infrastructure
OL,20,F(DfI), a spokesperson has said.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
